{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"This local estimate refers to regular wages only for Singapore citizens and permanent residents from their third year, it excludes bonuses and other extra wages, first and second year permanent residents, platform workers, annual wage caps and other payroll rules. Rates for employees above 55 to 65 change from January 1, 2027.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"singapore-cpf UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"nl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"singapore-cpf.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["singapore-cpf.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"nl","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Deze lokale schatting heeft betrekking op gewone lonen alleen voor Singapore burgers en permanente ingezetenen vanaf hun derde jaar. Het is exclusief bonussen en andere extra lonen, eerste en tweede jaar permanente ingezetenen, platform werknemers, jaarlijkse loonplafonds en andere payroll regels. Tarieven voor werknemers boven ZXQPH0000QXZ tot ZXQPH0001QXZ wijzigen vanaf januari ZXQPH0002QXZ, ZXQPH0003QXZ.","record_id":"a34af24398001ae8de9d1f787915cf8071f66f311dac85352db5e79ebc829a62","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":3.0411131002500014,"source":"This local estimate covers ordinary wages only for Singapore citizens and permanent residents from their third year onward. It excludes bonuses and other Additional Wages, first- and second-year permanent residents, platform workers, annual wage ceilings and other payroll rules. Rates for employees above 55 to 65 change from January 1, 2027. Check the current CPF Board rules before payroll use.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"ae2da644c1c409e76f86c8d02838389aa5a3b2e4ede17ea94e9c69f94a2bcab2","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Deze lokale schatting heeft betrekking op gewone lonen alleen voor Singapore burgers en permanente ingezetenen vanaf hun derde jaar. Het is exclusief bonussen en andere extra lonen, eerste en tweede jaar permanente ingezetenen, platform werknemers, jaarlijkse loonplafonds en andere payroll regels. Tarieven voor werknemers boven 55 tot 65 wijzigen vanaf januari 1, 2027.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
